Account pages now use the correct backend URL and CSP header on each multi-ingress domain. This applies to both ingress charts: `nginx-ingress-services` no longer includes the account-pages host in its generic CSP snippet, and `wire-ingress` (envoy-gateway) no longer injects a Content-Security-Policy response header on the account-pages route. The same fix is applied to the webapp route in `wire-ingress`, which had the same problem (`nginx-ingress-services` already skipped it).
